    {
      "id": "text_tb_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "text": "• Capacity = 10 tokens\n• Refill Rate = 5 tokens/sec\n\n⚡ Lazy Math Formula:\nTokens = min(Cap, Tokens + dt * Rate)\n\n• Request arrives:\n  tokens >= 1 -> Allowed (tokens--)\n  tokens < 1  -> HTTP 429 Too Many Req",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "seed": 203,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "rect_l4_l7",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 420,
