      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 30,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
      "text": "🌐 OSI L4 vs L7 Comparison",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "seed": 205,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "text_l4_l7_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "text": "Layer 4 (Transport LB):\n• IP + Port routing only (NAT/DSR)\n• Does NOT decrypt SSL / read HTTP\n• Blazing fast (Millions pkts/sec)\n\nLayer 7 (Application Proxy):\n• Full HTTP Path/Header/Cookie routing\n• Terminates Client TLS\n• 2 TCP Sockets: Client<->LB, LB<->Backend",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "seed": 206,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "rect_redis_lua",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 790,
      "y": 80,
